Blueprint Map renderer

This renderer is adapted from the interactive Map distributed by the
frenzymath/Poincare-Conjecture project, under Apache License 2.0.
The original project NOTICE is preserved verbatim in UPSTREAM-NOTICE.
The original project license is preserved verbatim in LICENSE.

The original map CSS and interaction code are retained. Adaptations for
Kervaire126Main replace the embedded project data with a local JSON fetch,
use local hgraph math assets and project references, and add links back to
the Kervaire Blueprint. No upstream theorem data or Lean source is included.
See PROVENANCE.md for source locations and retrieval hashes.

Further adaptations in SII-MATH/hgraph provide an opt-in native overlay,
a versioned same-origin lifecycle bridge, a host-derived native statement graph,
and a generated manifest pointing to the bundled KaTeX assets.
